w the memory controller interact\u2026</span><span class=\"form-note\" style=\"display:block;margin-top:10px;color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:700\">2026-04-30 \u00b7 Explained</span></a><a class=\"card card-pad article-card\" data-ncat=\"Explainer\" href=\"article.html?id=memory-bandwidth-explained\"><span class=\"chip\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\">Explainer</span><b style=\"display:block;color:var(--ink);margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.4\">Memory Bandwidth Explained: How Much Data Can Memory Move?</b><span class=\"form-note\">Understand memory bandwidth \u2014 how it&#x27;s calculated, why it matters, and how channels, speed, and bus width determine how fast your \u2026</span><span class=\"form-note\" style=\"display:block;margin-top:10px;color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:700\">2026-04-30 \u00b7 Explained</span></a><a class=\"card card-pad article-card\" data-ncat=\"Explainer\" href=\"article.html?id=cas-latency-explained\"><span class=\"chip\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\">Explainer</span><b style=\"display:block;color:var(--ink);margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.4\">CAS Latency Explained: Understanding Memory Response Time</b><span class=\"form-note\">CAS Latency (CL) is a critical memory timing parameter. Learn what it means, how it&#x27;s measured, and why lower latency improves sys\u2026</span><span class=\"form-note\" style=\"display:block;margin-top:10px;color:var(--accent-deep);font-weight:700\">2026-04-30 \u00b7 Explained</span></a><a class=\"card card-pad article-card\" data-ncat=\"Explainer\" href=\"article.html?id=memory-timings-explained\"><span class=\"chip\" style=\"align-self:flex-start\">Explainer</span><b style=\"display:block;color:var(--ink);margin:10px 0 8px;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.4\">Memory Timings Explained: Decoding RAM Specifications</b><span class=\"form-note\">Learn what memory timing numbers mean, how they affect performance, and how to interpret specifications like 16-18-18-38 and CL3